[vijñānabhairavabhaṭṭārakoyaṃ likhyate] |


oṃ namaḥ parama bhairavāya ||

śrutaṃ deva mayā sarvaṃ rudrayāmalasambhavam |
trikabhedamaśeṣeṇa sārātsāravibhāgaśaḥ || 1 ||

adyāpi na nivṛttaṃ me saṃśayaḥ parameśvara |
kiṃ navātmaka bhāvena bhairave bhairavākṛtau || 2 ||

<p. 73a> triśiro bhedabhinnātmā kiṃ vā śakti trayātmakam |
nādabindu mayaṃ vāpi kiṃ candrāvanirodhakam || 3 ||

cakrārūḍhamanaskaṃ vā kiṃ vā śakti svarūpakam |
parāparāyāḥ sakalamaparāyāśca vā punaḥ || 4 ||

parāyā yādi tadvat syāt puratvaṃ tadviruddhyate |
na hi varṇavibhedena dehabhedena vā bhavet || 5 ||

paratvaṃ niṣkalatvena sakalatvena tadbhavet |
prasādaṃ kuru me nātha niśśeṣaṃ cchindisaṃśayam || 6 ||

sādhu sādhu tvayā pṛṣṭaṃ tantrasāramidaṃ priye |
gūhanīyatamaṃ bhadre tathāpi kathayāmite || 7 ||

yatkiñcit sakalaṃ rūpaṃ bhairavasya prakīrtitam |
tadasāratayā devi vijñeyaṃ cakrajālavat || 8 ||

māyāsvapnopamaṃ caiva gandharvanagarabhramam |
dhyānārthaṃ bhrāntabuddhīnāṃ kriyāḍambaravartinām || 9 ||

kevalaṃ varṇitaṃ puṃsāṃ vikalpanihatātmanām |
tattvato na navātmāsau śabdarāśirna bhairavaḥ || 10 ||

na cāpi triśirā devo na ca śaktitrayātmakaḥ |
na cakrakramasaṃ bhinnaṃ na ca śaktisvarūpakaḥ || 11 ||

aprabuddhamatīnāṃ hi etābālavibhīṣikāḥ |
mātṛmodakavatsarvaṃ pravṛtyarthamudāhṛtam || 12 ||

dikkālakalanā muktā deśoddeśāṃ viśeṣiṇī |
vyapadeṣṭrasuśaktyāsānaśaktyāparamārthataḥ || 13 ||

antaḥ svānu bhavānandā vikalponmuktagocarā |
<p. 74a> yāvasthabharitākāryā bhairavī bhairavātmanaḥ || 14 ||

tadvapustattvato jñeyaṃ vimalaṃ viśvapūraṇam |
evaṃ vidhe pare tattve kaḥ pūjyarkaśca tṛpyati || 15 ||

evaṃ vidhā bhairavasya yāvasthā parigīyate |
sā parāpararūpeṇa parādevī prakīrtitā || 16 ||

śakti śakti mato yasmādabhedaḥ sarvadā sthitaḥ |
atastaddharmadharmitvāt parāśaktiḥ parātmanaḥ || 17 ||

na vahnerdāhikāśaktirvyatiriktā vibhāvyate |
kevalaṃ jñānasattāyāṃ prārambheyaṃ praveśane || 18 ||

śaktyovasthāṃ praviṣṭasya nirvibhāvena bhāvanā |
tadāsau śivarūpīsyāccaivīmukhamihocyate || 19 ||

yathā loke na dīpasya kiraṇairbhāsakarasya vā |
<p. 74b> jñāyate digvibhāgādi tadvadbhaktyā śivaḥ priye || 20 ||

deva deva triśūlāṅka kapālakṛtabhūṣaṇa |
digdeśakālaśūnyā ca vyapadeśīvavarjitā || 21 ||

yā śaktirbharatākārā bhairavaḥ sopalabhyate |
kairupāyairmukhaṃ tasya parādevī kathaṃ bhavet || 22 ||

yathā samyagahaṃ vedmi tathā me brūhi bhairava ||

ūrdhvaprāṇo hyadhojīvo visargātmāsaroccayet |
utpatti dvitayaṃ sthāne bharaṇādbhavita sthitiḥ || 24 ||

saratontarbahirvāpi vidyādyugmanivartanāt |
bhairavyā bhairavasyertthaṃ bhairavi vyajyate vapuḥ || 25 ||

na vrajenna viśecchaktirmarudrūpāvikāsate |
<p. 75a> nirvikalpatayāmadhye tathā bhairavarūpadhṛt || 26 ||

kumbhitāre citāvāpi pūritā vā yathābhavet |
tadante śāntanāmāsau śaktācāntaḥ prakāśate || 27 ||

āmūlātkiraṇābhāsaṃ sūkṣmāsūkṣmatarātmikam |
cintayonte dviṣaṭkānte śāmyante bhairavādayaḥ || 28 ||

udgacchantī taḍidrūpāṃ praticakraṃ kramāt kramam |
ūrdhvaṃ muṣṭitrayaṃ yāvat tāvadante mahodayaḥ || 29 ||

bhramadvādaśakaṃ samyag dvādaśākṣarabheditam |
sthūlasūkṣmaparisthityā muktvā muktvā tataḥ śivaḥ || 30 ||

tayā pūryāstu mūrddhāntaṃ bhakṣyābhṛkṣe pasettanā |
nirvikalpaṃ manaḥ kṛtvā sarvorddhve sarvagodgamaḥ || 31 ||

śikhipakṣaiścittarūpairmaṇḍalaiḥ śūnyapañcakam |
<p. 75b> dhyāyatonuttaraḥ śūnye praviśo hṛdaye bhavet || 32 ||

īdṛśena krameṇaiva yatra yatrāpi cintayet |
śūnye vaktre pare pātre svayaṃ līnā varapradā || 33 ||

kapālāntarmanonyasya tiṣṭhenmīlita locanaḥ |
krameṇa manaso dārḍhyāllakṣate lakṣamuttamam || 34 ||

madhyanāḍī madhyasaṃsthā visasūtrāvasū trayā |
dhyātāttayo mahādevyā tayā devaḥ prakāśate || 35 ||

kararuddha dṛgastena bhrūbhedāddvārarodanāt |
dṛṣṭe bindau kramālīne tanmadhye paramāsthitiḥ || 36 ||

dhāmāntaḥ kṣobhasambhūtā sūkṣmāgni tilakā kṛtiḥ |
binduṃ śikhānte hṛdaye layānte dhyāyate layaḥ || 37 ||

<p. 76a> anāhate pātrakarṇe bhagnaśabdapariśrute |
śabdabrahmaṇi niṣṇātaḥ paraṃ brahmādhi gacchati || 38 ||

praṇavādi samuccārāt plutānte śūnyabhāvanāt |
śūnyayā parayā śaktyā śūnyatā ceti bhairavi || 39 ||

yasya yasyāpi varṇasya pūrvāntāvanu bhāvayet |
śūnyayā śūnya bhūtosau śūnyākāraḥ pumānbhavet || 40 ||

tantryādi vādyaśabdeṣu dīrgheṣu kramasaṃsthitaḥ |
ananyacetāḥ pratyante paraṃvyomavapurbhavet || 41 ||

piṇḍamātrasya sarvasya sūkṣmamantrakrameṇa tu |
ardhendubindunādāntaḥ śūnyoccārādbhavacchivaḥ || 42 ||

nijadehe sarvadikkaṃ yugapadbhāvayeddvayam |
nirvikalpamanāstasya viyatsarvaṃ pravartate || 43 ||

<p. 76b> pṛṣṭhaśūnyaṃ mūlaśūnyaṃ yugapadbhāvaye ca yaḥ |
yugapannirvikalpatvānnirvikalponayastataḥ || 44 ||

tanūddeśe śūnyatayā kṣaṇamātraṃ vibhāvayet |
nirvikalpaṃ nirvikalpe nirvikalpā svarūpabhāk || 45 ||

sarvadehagataṃ dravyaṃ ni (*) dvyāptaṃ mṛgekṣaṇe |
vibhaveyadyatastasya bhāvanā sā sthirī bhavet || 46 ||

na kiñcidantaraṃ tasya dhyāyannadhyeya bhāgbhavet |
hṛdyākāśavilīnākṣaḥ padmasaṃpuṭamadhyagaḥ || 47 ||

ananya cetāḥ subhage paraṃ saubhāgyamāpnuyāt |
sarvataḥ svaśarīrasya dvādaśāntaṃ manā nayet || 48 ||

dṛḍhabuddhirdṛḍhībhūtaṃ tattvalakṣaṃ pravartate |
<p. 77a> yathā yathā yatra yatra dvādaśānte manaḥ kṣipet || 49 ||

pratikṣaṇaṃ kṣīṇavṛttervai lakṣaṇyaṃ dinairbhavet |
kālāgninā kālapurādurthi tena svakaṃ puram || 50 ||

pluṣṭaṃ vicintayedante śāntābhāsastadā bhavet |
evameva jagatsarvaṃ dagdhaṃ dhyātvā vikalpitaḥ || 51 ||

ananyacetasaḥ puṃsaḥ puṃbhāvaḥ paramo bhavet |
svadehe jagato vāpi sūkṣmasūkṣmatarāṇi ca || 52 ||

tattvāni yāni nirayaṃ dhyātvāntarvyathate parā |
pīnāṃ ca durlabhāṃ caiva dhyātvā dvādaśagocare || 53 ||

praviśya hṛdaye dhyāyanyuktaḥ svātantrya māpnuyāt |
bhuvanatvādi rūpeṇa cintayettapasokhilam || 54 ||

sūkṣmasthūlaparityāgaṃ yāvaddatte manolayaḥ |
asya sarvasya viśvasya paryanteṣu samantataḥ || 55 ||

<p. 77b> adhvaprakriyayā tattvaṃ devaṃ dhyātvā mahodayaḥ |
viśvametanmahādevi śūnyabhūtaṃ vicintayet || 56 ||

tatraiva śamanolīnaṃ tatastallayabhājanam |
nirvṛkṣagiribhittyādi deśe dṛṣṭiṃ vinikṣipet || 57 ||

vilīne mānase bhāve vṛttikṣīṇā prajāyate |
ubhayorbhāvayorjñāne dhyātvā madhyaṃ samāśrayet || 58 ||

yugapaśca dvayaṃ tyaktvā madhye tattvaṃ prakāśate |
bhāve tyakte niruddhā cennaiva bhāvāntaraṃ vrajet || 59 ||

tadātanmadhyabhāvena vikasatyati bhāvanā |
sarvadehe tanmayaṃ hi jagadvā paribhāvayet || 60 ||

yugapannirvikalpena manasā paramodbhavaḥ |
vāyu dvayasya saṅghaṭṭādantarvā bahirantataḥ || 61 ||

<p. 78a> yogī sa tattvavijñānaṃ samutgamanabhājanam |
sarvaṃ jagat svadehaṃ vā svānandabharitaṃ smaret || 62 ||

yugapat svādṛtenaiva parānandamayo bhavet |
kuhareṇa prayogena sadya eva mṛge kṣaṇe || 63 ||

samudena mahānande yena tattvaṃ prakāśate |
sarvasroto nibandhena prāṇaśaktyādhvaśāsanaiḥ || 64 ||

pippīlasparśa velāyāṃ prathame paramaṃ sukham |
vahnerviṣaya madhye tu cittaṃ sukha mayaṃkṣipet || 65 ||

kevalaṃ vāyupūrṇaṃ vā smarānandena yujyate |
śaktisaṅgamasaṃkṣubdhaṃ śaktyā veśāvasānikam || 66 ||

yat sukhaṃ brahmatattvasya tatsukhaṃ svaikyamucyate |
lehanāmaktanākoṭo strīmukhasya bharāt smṛteḥ || 67 ||

<p. 78b> śaktyā bhāvepi deveśi bhavedānandasaṃplavaḥ |
ānande mahate prāpte dṛṣṭe vā bāndhave cirāt || 68 ||

ānandamutgataṃ dhyātvā tallayastanmanā bhavet |
dagdhamānarasollāsa rasānandavijṛmbhanāt || 69 ||

tāvatodbharitāvasthāṃ mahānandastato bhavet |
gītādi viṣayā svādātsamasaukhyaikatanmanaḥ || 70 ||

yosinastanmayatvena manorūḍhestadātmanā |
yatra yatra manassṛṣṭirmanastatraiva dhārayet || 71 ||

tatra tatra parānandaḥ svarūpaḥ saṃprakāśate |
anāgatāyāṃ nidrāyāṃ pranaṣṭe bāhyagocare || 72 ||

sāvasthā manasā gamyā parādevī prakāśate |
tejasā sūrya dīpāderākāśeśavalī kṛte || 73 ||

79a> dṛṣṭiṃ niveśya tatraiva svātmarūpaṃ prakāśate |
karaṅkiṇye krodhanayā bhairavyā lelihānayā || 74 ||

khecaryā dṛṣṭikāle ca parāvyāptiḥ prakāśate |
mṛdvāsanesphijaikena hastapādau nirāśrayam || 75 ||

vidhāyatatprasaṅgena parāpūrṇāmatirbhavet |
upaviśyāsanesamyagbāhūrkṛtvāvakuñcitau || 76 ||

kakṣavyomni manaḥ kurvañca samānaṃ ca cintayet |
sthūlarūpasya bhāvasya savyāṃ dṛṣṭiṃ nipātayet || 77 ||

acireṇa nirādhāraṃ manaḥ kṛtvā śivaṃ vrajet |
āsane śayane sthitvā nirādhāraṃ vibhāvayet || 78 ||

svadehaṃ manasi kṣīṇe kṣīṇātkṣīṇāśayā bhavet |
calāsane sthitasyāthaśanairvā dehacālanāt || 79 ||

<p. 79b> praśānte mānuse bhāve devidivyaugha māpnuyāt |
līnaṃ mūrdhni viyatsarvaṃ bhairavatvena bhāvayet || 80 ||

tatsarvaṃ bhairavākāraṃ tejastatvaṃ samāviśet |
kiñcijjñātve dvetadāyi bāhyalokastamaḥ punaḥ || 81 ||

vidvāvi bhairavaṃ rūpaṃ jñātvānanta prakāśavat |
evamevaṃ durnimāyā kṛṣṇapakṣāgame ciram || 82 ||

taimiraṃ bhāvayedrūpaṃ bhāvayedbhairavo bhavet |
yasya yasyendriyasyāpi vyāghātāśca nirodhataḥ || 83 ||

praviṣṭasyā dvaye śūnye taddaivātmā prakāśayet |
abdhindu sa visargaṃ ca akāraṃ japato mahān || 84 ||

udeti devi sahasājñānaughaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
sa visargasya varṇasya visargāntaṃ citi kuru || 85 ||

<p. 80a> nirādhāreṇa cittena spṛśedbrahmasanātanam |
vyomākāraṃ svamātmānaṃ dhyāne digbhiranāvṛtam || 86 ||

nirāśaya citiḥ śaktiḥ svarūpe darśayet tadā |
kiñcidaṅgaṃ vibhāvyādau tīkṣṇasūcyādinā tataḥ || 87 ||

tatraiva cetanā yuktā bhairaveṇāmalāgatiḥ |
cittādyantaḥ kṛtannāsti samantarbhāvayediti || 88 ||

vikalpanāmabhāvena vikalpairujjhito bhavet |
mayā vimohanī nāma kalāyāḥ kalanaṃ sthitam || 89 || 

(*) (*) di tattvaṃ dharmāṇāṃ kalayanna pṛthag bhavet |
jagatīicchāṃ samutpannāmavalokyaśamaṃ nayet || 90 ||

yata eva samudbhūtā tatastataiva līyate |
yadāmamecchānotpannā jñānaṃ vākastadāsmi vai || 91 ||

<p. 80b> tattvatohaṃ tadā bhūtastallīnastanmano bhavet |
icchāyāmathavā jñāne jāte cittaṃ niveśayet || 92 ||

ātmabuddhyānānyacetā tatastattvātmadarśanam |
nirādhāraṃ bhavejjñānaṃ nirnimittaṃ bhramātmakam || 93 ||

tattvatarkasya cinnaita devaṃ vyāpī śivaḥ priye |
ciddharmā sarvadeheṣu viśeṣo nāsti kutracit || 94 ||

ataśca tanmayaṃ sarvaṃ bhāvayedbhavajījjanaḥ |
kāmakrodhalobhamohamadamātsaryagocaraḥ || 95 ||

buddhiṃ nistimibhāṃ(?) kṛtvā tattattvamavaśiṣyate |
indrajālamayaviśvaṃ nyastaṃ vā cittrakarmavat || 96 ||

bhramadvā dhyāyataḥ sarvaṃ paśyataśca sukhodgamaḥ |
na cittaṃ nikṣipedduḥkhena sukhe vā parikṣipet || 97 ||

<p. 81a> bhairavi jyāyatāṃ madhye kiṃ tattvamavaśiṣyate |
vihāya nijadehasthaṃ sarvaṃ nāsmīti bhāvayet || 98 ||

dṛḍhena manasā dṛṣṭyā nānvekṣiṇyā sukhī bhavet |
ghaṭādau yacca vijñānamicchādyaṃ vāmamāntare || 99 ||

naiva sarvagataṃ jātaṃ bhāvayanniti sarvagaḥ |
grāhyagrāhakasaṃvittiḥ sāmānyā sarvadehinām || 100 ||

yogināṃ tu viśeṣosti sambandhe sāvadhānatā ||

svasmādanyaśarīrepi saṃvitti manubhāvayet |
apīkṣāṃ svaśarīrasya tyaktvā vāsī sukhī bhavet ||

nirādhāraṃ manaḥ kṛtvā vikalpaṃ na vikalpayet | 
tadātma paramātmatve bhairavo mṛgalocane || 103 ||

sarvajñaḥ sarvakartā ca vyāpakaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
<p. 81b> sa evāhaṃ caiva dharmā iti dārḍhyā bhavecchivaḥ || 4 ||

jalasyaivormayo vahnerjvālābhaṅgaḥ prabhābharaḥ |
mamaiva bhairavasyetā viśvabhaṅgyavibheditāḥ || 5 ||

bhrāntvā bhrāntvā śarīreṇa tvaritaṃ tu vipātanāt |
kṣobhaśaktivirāmeṇa parāsañjāyate daśā || 6 ||

ādhāre tvathavā śaktyā dhyānāccittatalena vā |
jātaśaktisamāveśa kṣobhante bhairavaṃ vapuḥ || 7 ||

saṃpradāyamidaṃ bhadre śṛṇu samyag varānane |
kaivalyaṃ jāyate sadyo netrayoḥ stabdhamātrayoḥ || 8 ||

daśādhike mahāgarte sthitvopari nirīkṣaṇāt |
avikalpamate samyak sadyaccittanayasphuṭam || 9 ||

yatra yatra mano yāti bāhye bāhyāntarepi vā |
<p. 82a> tatra tatra śivāvasthā vyāpakatvātkayāsyati || 10 ||

yatra yatrākṣamārgeṇa caitanyaṃ vyajyate vibhoḥ |
tasya tanmātradharmitvāccillayādbharitātmatā || 11 ||

kṣutādyante bhayeśoke gahvare vāraṇadrute |
kurdhahale kṣudhādyante brahmasattā mayī paśā || 12 ||

vastuṣu sma(?)ryamāṇeṣu dṛṣṭe deśemanastyajet |
svaśarīraṃ nirādhāraṃ tataḥ prasarati prabhuḥ || 13 ||

kvacidvastu na bindasya śanairdṛṣṭiṃ nivartayet |
tajjñānaṃ (*) (*)(?) sahitaṃ dehi śūnyālayo bhavet || 14 ||

bhaktyadrekādviraktasya yādṛśī jñāyate ratiḥ |
sā śaktiḥ śāṅkarī nityaṃ bhāvayerthaṃ tataḥ śivaḥ || 15 ||

vastvantare vedyamāne śanairvastuṣu śūnyatā |
<p. 82b> tāmevamanu sā dhyātvā viditopi praśāmyati || 16 ||

kiñcijjñairyaḥ smṛtā śuddhissaśuddhiśśambhudarśane |
na śucirhyaśucistasmānnirvikalpaḥ sukhī bhavet || 17 ||

sarvatra bhairavo bhāvaḥ sāmānye ṣvevagocare |
na ca tadvyatirekena parostītyadvayā gatiḥ || 18 ||

samaḥ śattrau ca mitre ca samomānāvamānayoḥ |
brahmaṇaḥ paripūrṇatvāditi jñātvā sukhī bhavet || 19 ||

na dveṣa bhāvayoḥ (*) (*) (*)(?) na rāgaṃ bhāvayet kvacit |
rāgadveṣavinirmukto madhye brahmaprasarpati || 20 ||

yadi vedyaṃ yadā grāhyaṃ yacchūnyaṃ yadavāvagam |
tatsarvaṃ bhairavaṃ bhāvyaṃ tadante rodhasambhavam || 21 ||

nitye nirāśaye śūnye vyāpake kalanojjhite |
bāhyākāśe manaḥ kṛtvā nirākāśaṃ samāviśet || 22 ||

<p. 83a> yatra yatra manoyāti tattatte naiva lakṣaṇam |
parityajya navaḥ sthityā nistaraṅgastato bhavet || 23 ||

kriyātsarvaṃ ravayati sarva devyāpakokhile |
iti bhairavaśabdasya santatoścāraṇā cchivaḥ || 24 ||

ahaṃ sa samayetyādi pratipatti prasaṅgataḥ |
nirādhāre manojāti taddhyānā preraṇācchamī || 25 ||

nityo vibhurnirādhāro vyāpakaścākhilādhipaḥ |
śabdāḥ pratikṣaṇaṃ dhyāyanprakṛtārthānurūpataḥ || 26 ||

atattvamindrajālābhamidaṃ sarvamavasthitam |
kiṃ tatvamindrajālasya iti dārḍhyācchayaṃ vrajet || 27 ||

ātmano nirvikārasya kva jñānaṃ kva ca vā kriyā |
jñānāyatā bahirbhāvādataḥ śūnyamidaṃ jagat || 28 ||

<p. 83b> na me bandhana mokṣometī tasyaiva vibhīṣikāḥ |
pratibimbamidaṃ buddherjaleṣvivavivasvataḥ || 29 ||

indriyadvārakaṃ sarvaṃ sukhaduḥkhādi saṅgamam |
itīndriyāṇi santyajya svasthaḥ svātmani vartate || 30 ||

jñānaṃ prakāśakaṃ sarvaṃ sarvamātmāprakāśakaḥ |
evameva svabhāvatvājjñānajñeyo vibhāvyate || 31 ||

mānasaṃ cetanā śaktirātmā ceti catuṣṭayam |
yadā priyo parikṣīṇaṃ tadātadbhairavaṃ vapuḥ || 32 ||

nistaraṅgā padeśānāṃ śatamuktāsamāsataḥ |
dvādaśābhyadhikaṃ devi yajjñātvā jñānavijjanaḥ || 33 ||

atra caiva tape yukte jāyate bhairavaḥ svayam | 
<p. 84a> vācākaroti karmāṇi śāpānugrahakārakaḥ || 34 ||

ajarāmaratāmeti soṇimādi guṇānvitaḥ |
yoginīnāṃ priyo devi sarvamelāpakādhipaḥ || 35 ||

jīvannapi vimuktosau kurvannapi ca ceṣṭitam || 36 ||

idaṃ yadi vapurdeva parāyāśca maheśvara |
evamuktvāvyavasthāyāṃ japate ko japaścakaḥ || 37 ||

eṣātra prakriyā vakṣye sthūleṣyeva mṛgekṣaṇe |
bhūyobhūyaḥ pare bhāve bhāvanā bhāvyate yathā || 38 ||

dhyāne yā niścalā buddhirnirākārā nirāśrayā |
na tu dhyānaṃ śarīrādi mukhahastādi kalpanā || 39 ||

prajānāmanna puṣpādyairyā matiḥ kriyate dṛḍhā |
nirvikalpe pare vyomni sā pūjā hyadarāllayaḥ || 40 ||

<p. 84b> mahāśūnyā laye vahnau bhūtākṣaviṣayādikam |
hūyate manasā sārdhaṃ sa homaścetanā srucā || 41 ||

yāgetra parameśāni tuṣṭirānanda lakṣaṇā |
kṣapaṇāt sarvapāpānāṃ trāṇātsarvasya pārvati || 42 ||

rudraśakti samāveśastatkṣetraṃ bhāvanā parā |
anyathā tasya tandrasya kā pūjā kaśca tṛpyati || 43 ||

yaireva pūjyate dravyaistarpate vā parāparaḥ |
yaścaiva pūjakaḥ sarvaṃ sa evaikaḥ prapūjanam || 44 ||

vrajet prāṇo viśejjīva icchāyā kuṭilā kṛtiḥ |
dīrghātmā sā mahādevī parakṣettraṃ parāparā || 45 ||

asyānu caratastiṣṭhenmahānandamayedhvare |
tathādevā samāviṣṭaḥ paraṃ bhairavamāpnuyāt || 46 ||

<p. 85a> ṣaṭkatāni divārātrau sahasrāṇyeka viṃśatiḥ |
japo devyāḥ samuddiṣṭaḥ prāṇasyānte sudurlabhaḥ || 47 ||

itye tatkathitaṃ devi paramāmṛtamuttamam |
etacca naiva kasyāpi prakāśyaṃ na kadācana || 48 ||

pariśiṣyekhile krūre abhakte gurupādayoḥ |
nirvikalpamatīnāṃ tu vīrāṇāmunnatātmanām || 49 ||

bhaktānāṃ guruvargasya dātavyaṃ nirviśaṅkayā |
grāmorājyaṃ parodeśaḥ putradārakuṭumbhakam || 50 ||

sarvametatparityajya grāhyametandṛgekṣaṇe |
prāṇā api pradātavyā na deyaṃ paramā mṛtam || 51 ||

deva deva mahādeva paritṛptāsmi śaṅkara |
rudrayāmala mantrasya sarasadyāvadhāritam || 52 |

<p. 85b> sarvaśakti prabhedānāṃ hṛdayaṃ jñātamadya ca |
ityuktvā nanditā devī kaṇṭhe lagnā śivasya tu || 53 ||

